  "sourceText": "Fish Cakes\nBy: Alisa Escanlar\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups canned salmon, tuna or m\nCocktail sauce optional\n1 cup cold mashed potatoes\n1/2 cup minced onion\n2 teaspoons lemon juice\n2 eggs beaten\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n1/2 teaspoon pepper\n1/2 cup all purpose flour\n1/2 cup oil\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine first 7 ingredients, mix well. Shape into 8 patties. Dredge in flour, fry fish cakes in hot oil about 10 minutes or until brown, turn once. Drain well.",
